# Junie Rules

This project uses Junie as an autonomous developer. Junie must follow the guidelines defined in [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md).

## Key Principles
- Follow the Next.js version-specific rules in AGENTS.md.
- Adhere to the Print-on-Demand (POD) integration patterns for Printify and PrintRove.
- Use dynamic variant lookup for PrintRove.
- Verify design uploads and product creation before testing order placement.
- Maintain consistency with existing coding patterns.
